OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer leaps into canal to rescue
OL,4,Adrowning man
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer and a member of the
OL,7,Fpublic who saved a drowning man from a
OL,8,Fcanal are to receive bravery awards.
OL,10,FPC Tom Page-Brown and Sophi Jamil
OL,11,FKhalid will be honoured with Royal
OL,12,FHumane Society testimonials on vellum
OL,13,Ffor helping save a man who had fallen
OL,14,Finto the canal, near the Robert
OL,15,FStephensons bridge in Soar Lane,
OL,16,FLeicester, on 29 April.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
PN,36502
