OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1794378416
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer leaps into canal to rescue
OL,4,Adrowning man
OL,5,
OL,6,FPage-Brown, who told the BBC he
OL,7,Fhappened to be nearby at the end of his
OL,8,Fshift when he was called to the scene,
OL,9,Fsaid he had "no choice" but to enter
OL,10,Fthe water as he saw the man disappear
OL,11,Fbeneath the surface.
OL,13,F"I thought if I don't do something,
OL,14,Fthat guy is probably going to pass away
OL,15,Fbecause he's literally drowning in
OL,16,Ffront of my eyes," he said.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
